# A10 (2026-10-25): these casts compile, and the two indexed accesses carry
# bank $70 ($708040 = 32832 + 112 << 16) to an indirect-long access.
in put_far: present adc\.w #112
in put_far: present sta \[tcc__(?:r9|lf\+\d+)\]
in get_const: present adc\.w #112
in get_const: present lda \[tcc__(?:r9|lf\+\d+)\]
in put_reg: present sta\.l \$002100
